# Simulation / Logs
**/logs/**
!**/logs/**/
**/logs/**/*.mp4
!**/logs/**/*.tfevents*
# Intermediate checkpoints: with checkpoint_interval=10000 a 500k run writes 50 of these
# (~116 MB). Only best_agent.pt is kept in the repo.
**/logs/**/agent_[0-9]*.pt
!**/logs/**/best_agent.pt
!**/logs/**/*mujoco_eval_report*.json
!**/logs/**/*.yaml
*.jit
.launcher_last_command.json

